#
# Format (one source per line, BSD `shaNsum --tag` style):
#   HASHTYPE (filename) = hexdigest
#
# - HASHTYPE : SHA512 (preferred) or SHA256.
# - filename : must match the Source0:/SourceN: filename in your .spec.
# - hexdigest: checksum of the tarball.
